extends /specs/page-structure/layout.jade

block content
    h1 Drawer
    p sliding drawer navigation, which contains links to pages all around the website

    section.source_section
        h2 Default set-up
        p Use HTMl attributes to control Drawer

        h3 Drawer toggle
        p adding an anchor to toggle the nav

        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            |   <a href="#targetNav" data-target="#targetNav" data-toggle="nav">
            |       <i class="icon-menu2" aria-hidden="true">Main menu</i>
            |       <i class="icon-close_thin" aria-hidden="true">Close main menu </i>
            |   </a>

        markdown
            p use `data-target` and `data-toggle="nav"` to the anchor

        h3 Target nav
        markdown
            p adding an `id="targetNav"` same as `data-target` value to the div that will slide

        code.src-html.source_visible.source_example
            |   <div id="targetNav" class="drawer__nav">
            |       <nav role="navigation" >
            |           .....
            |       </nav>
            |   </div>

    section.source_section
        h2 Working example
        .source_example
            a(href="#" ) link
            .main-nav
                a(href="#mainNav" data-target="mainNav" data-toggle="nav" )
                    i.icon-menu2(aria-hidden="true")
                    i.icon-close_thin(aria-hidden="true")
                #mainNav.drawer__nav
                    nav(role="navigation" class="main-menu container")
                        ul.rlist--inline
                            li
                                a(href="#") Journals
                            li
                                a(href="#") Books
                            li
                                a(href="#") Proceedings
                            li
                                a(href="#") Blog
            p Nam libero tempore, cum soluta nobis est eligendi optio cumque nihil impedit quo minus id quod maxime placeat facere possimus, omnis voluptas assumenda est, omnis dolor repellendusNam libero tempore, cum soluta nobis est eligendi optio cumque nihil impedit quo minus id quod maxime placeat facere possimus, omnis voluptas assumenda est, omnis dolor repellendusNam libero tempore, cum soluta nobis est eligendi optio cumque nihil impedit quo minus id quod maxime placeat facere possimus, omnis voluptas assumenda est, omnis dolor repellendusNam libero tempore, cum soluta nobis est eligendi optio cumque nihil impedit quo minus id quod maxime placeat facere possimus, omnis voluptas assumenda est, omnis dolor repellendus
            a(href="#" ) link
        markdown
            p <strong>Note: </strong> In the example above, the anchors that hold "link" as value are not part of the template and shouldn't be used along with the structure. they were added to support and demonstrate  some accessibility functionality.


